flowchart TD
  accTitle: Place the work; preserve its owner.
  accDescr: Proposed shared placement and admission: harness/model, target environment, and provisioning are separate choices. Sandbox candidates share one category: Blaxel, Modal, Daytona, E2B, Baseten, and others. Capabilities differ; batch jobs are optional. Provisioning does not transfer ownership. Persist artifacts and reconcile uncertain attempts before retrying.
  ready --> policy
  policy --> reserve
  reserve --> local
  local --> attempt
  attempt --> durable
  durable --> result
  reserve --> sandbox
  sandbox --> attempt
  ready["Ready task + requirements"]
  policy["Capability / budget / locality"]
  reserve["Select + reserve capacity"]
  local["Local or linked T3 environment"]
  attempt["Owned, observable attempt"]
  durable["Persist artifacts + reconcile"]
  result["Return evidence to thread"]
  sandbox["Remote SandboxProvider"]
